`,s.jsx(a.p,{children:"This entry is the first in a series of entries that are paired into pairs of a rigorous overview of the analytical foundations of a subject, followed by an examination of the same topics via numerical methods using tools and frameworks established in the field of numerical analysis. As such, each pair in the series is mostly self contained, although some cross-referencing will happen on occasion, especially in closely related field (such as differential and integral calculus)."}),`
`,s.jsx(a.p,{children:"Each pair serves a dual purpose:"}),`
